    <string name="supported_formats_detail">APM Open Player decodes with libVLC (FFmpeg), so it opens every container and codec below — including the surround and lossless audio formats most phones refuse.\n\nVIDEO CONTAINERS\nMP4, MKV, WEBM, AVI, MOV, QT, WMV, ASF, FLV, F4V, TS, M2TS, MTS, M2V, VOB, OGV, 3GP, MPG, MPEG, RM, RMVB, DIVX, MXF, NSV, M1V\n\nVIDEO CODECS\nH.264/AVC, HEVC/H.265, AV1, VP8, VP9, MPEG-1/2/4, VC-1, WMV1/2/3, H.263, ProRes, DNxHD, DV, Theora, FFV1, QuickTime RLE\n\nAUDIO FORMATS\nMP3, AAC, M4A, FLAC, WAV, AIFF, OGG, OPUS, VORBIS, WMA, APE, WavPack, TTA, ALAC, DTS, AC3, E-AC3, TrueHD, MP2, AMR, MIDI\n\nSUBTITLES\nSRT, ASS, SSA, SUB/IDX (VobSub), VTT, SMI, PGS (Blu-ray), DVB, MOV text\n\nNETWORK\nHTTP, HTTPS, RTSP, RTMP, UDP, TCP, SRT, MMS, FTP, HLS (.m3u8), DASH (.mpd)</string>

